WEBVTT

00:17.550 --> 00:18.320
Legend has it

00:18.640 --> 00:21.160
that the immortals killed the ancient demon god,

00:21.160 --> 00:22.190
the Mortal-Demon Lord,

00:22.710 --> 00:24.760
but couldn't destroy its spiritual power.

00:25.600 --> 00:26.800
So they had to seal the Spirit Spring

00:26.800 --> 00:28.120
that formed from its power

00:28.400 --> 00:29.720
in the netherworld.

00:30.550 --> 00:33.470
The Spirit Spring gathers evil intentions of the heaven and earth,

00:33.490 --> 00:35.530
with enough power to destroy the universe.

00:36.110 --> 00:37.600
Only the chosen Demon's child

00:38.040 --> 00:39.920
can release the Spirit Spring.

00:40.470 --> 00:41.750
Eighteen years ago,

00:41.980 --> 00:44.020
Mu Qingge stole the Spirit Spring,

00:44.150 --> 00:45.280
causing chaos to the mortal world.

00:45.600 --> 00:46.840
Alerted, the four other Heavenly Sects

00:46.840 --> 00:47.920
joined hands against her

00:48.110 --> 00:50.000
but still were no match for her.

00:53.880 --> 00:57.020
[Legend]

01:06.430 --> 01:07.560
Heavenly disciples!

01:08.030 --> 01:09.120
Kill Mu Qingge!

01:08.150 --> 01:09.670
[Immortal Kaiyuan, Sovereign of Eternal Sect]

01:09.480 --> 01:10.070
Yes!

01:19.870 --> 01:20.630
[Mu Qingge, Wester Sect]

01:59.310 --> 02:00.200
Good one, disciple.

02:00.760 --> 02:02.200
I thought you asked me here

02:02.280 --> 02:03.590
to reminisce about the past.

02:02.620 --> 02:03.770
[Su Yishui, Wester Sect]

02:04.040 --> 02:05.400
To think you'd be so heartless

02:05.640 --> 02:06.840
as to collude with others to harm me!

02:06.980 --> 02:07.620
You demon!

02:08.520 --> 02:09.750
You forced me to be your disciple

02:09.900 --> 02:10.710
and practice black magic!

02:11.310 --> 02:11.910
How's there

02:11.910 --> 02:13.000
anything real between us?

02:13.470 --> 02:14.590
Want to kill your master?

02:15.000 --> 02:16.520
Let's see if you're up to it!

02:23.360 --> 02:24.120
Formation!

02:39.079 --> 02:41.120
Trying to kill me with my blood?

02:41.579 --> 02:42.400
Su Yishui.

02:42.870 --> 02:43.750
Do you hate me this much?

03:06.350 --> 03:07.040
Yishui...

03:07.630 --> 03:08.430
Your face...

03:58.710 --> 04:00.030
Even if I die,

04:00.360 --> 04:01.840
Wester Sect will perish with me.

04:02.190 --> 04:03.640
Wester Sect never forgives traitors.

04:03.840 --> 04:04.400
Su Yishui.

04:04.800 --> 04:06.400
You'll never be able to hold your head up high again!

04:07.400 --> 04:08.470
Mu Qingge!

05:37.770 --> 05:42.130
[Love of the Divine Tree]

05:43.030 --> 05:45.030
[Episode 1]

05:46.110 --> 05:49.760
[18 years later]
[Xue Village near Mount Absolute]

05:47.600 --> 05:49.190
They say that right before her death,

05:49.480 --> 05:51.210
this demoness even cursed her disciple,

05:51.240 --> 05:52.070
Su Yishui,

05:52.360 --> 05:54.720
with the Face-and-Heart Burning Curse.

05:54.790 --> 05:56.720
It was utterly humiliating.

05:56.950 --> 05:58.480
Her cruelty didn't end here.

05:58.600 --> 05:59.190
Mu Qingge

05:59.190 --> 06:00.480
merged her fate

06:00.550 --> 06:02.160
with the sovereign order

06:02.190 --> 06:03.310
of Wester Sect.

06:03.310 --> 06:04.120
If she dies,

06:04.310 --> 06:06.040
the disciples of Wester Sect will die!

06:06.800 --> 06:08.510
What a vicious demon!

06:08.680 --> 06:10.120
So Su Yishui had no choice

06:10.120 --> 06:11.680
but to find a Reincarnation Tree

06:11.950 --> 06:13.950
and a trace of her remaining soul.

06:14.430 --> 06:16.090
With half of his Golden Core,

06:16.120 --> 06:17.310
he helped her be reborn,

06:17.830 --> 06:19.430
in hopes that with her return,

06:19.680 --> 06:22.120
her curse on Wester Sect would be broken

06:22.810 --> 06:24.040
and she'd help him

06:24.070 --> 06:26.390
locate the missing Spirit Spring.

06:27.650 --> 06:28.650
Sovereign Su

06:28.670 --> 06:31.080
is such an upright and honorable man,

06:31.360 --> 06:33.240
yet he had to extend a demon's life.

06:33.600 --> 06:36.480
What an abominable pity!

06:36.830 --> 06:37.870
So how long

06:38.040 --> 06:38.950
does it take to

06:38.950 --> 06:39.920
resurrect that demoness?

06:40.390 --> 06:41.560
Eighteen years.

06:42.240 --> 06:43.120
Mu Qingge

06:43.870 --> 06:45.680
is coming back soon!

06:49.240 --> 06:50.040
Dear audience,

06:50.950 --> 06:52.240
the tales of Mount Wester

06:52.270 --> 06:53.870
will end here today!

06:54.520 --> 06:56.330
If you're worried that the demoness

06:56.360 --> 06:57.390
will harm the mortal world,

06:57.510 --> 06:58.720
why don't you get prepared?

06:58.860 --> 06:59.680
I have portraits

06:59.680 --> 07:01.390
of the righteous demon-slaying sovereign,

07:01.530 --> 07:03.260
Su Yishui, available for purchase.

07:03.360 --> 07:04.480
One cash for one.

07:04.680 --> 07:06.040
It'll subdue evil

07:06.040 --> 07:07.360
and keep your home safe.

07:07.800 --> 07:08.920
Anyone interested?

07:09.070 --> 07:09.950
Grab one while you can.

07:10.240 --> 07:10.950
Old Li.

07:11.240 --> 07:12.350
Who'd want to buy that?

07:12.870 --> 07:13.630
In my opinion,

07:13.920 --> 07:14.720
that man's so heartless

07:14.950 --> 07:15.930
for killing his master.

07:16.310 --> 07:17.750
He's no saint.

07:17.920 --> 07:19.190
-What are you talking about?
-Watch your words!

07:20.680 --> 07:22.920
Killing your master for justice is noble.

07:23.240 --> 07:24.000
Su Yishui

07:24.120 --> 07:25.560
will attain ascension sooner or later.

07:26.160 --> 07:28.120
Slandering him will bring you bad luck!

07:28.480 --> 07:29.510
You're the unlucky one!

07:29.920 --> 07:30.920
Ranran!

07:31.270 --> 07:32.600
Why are you in an argument again?

07:32.870 --> 07:33.270
Let's go.

07:33.290 --> 07:34.550
We need to get back to work.

07:37.480 --> 07:38.750
-I want one.
-I want one.

07:38.750 --> 07:39.680
-Give me one.
-Give me one.

07:40.020 --> 07:40.950
-Me too.
-Me too.

07:51.520 --> 07:52.230
Ranran!

08:02.310 --> 08:03.000
Ranran.

08:03.440 --> 08:04.190
Smells good.

08:04.750 --> 08:05.240
Serve the dishes.

08:05.750 --> 08:06.190
Okay.

08:08.920 --> 08:09.720
I'm Xue Ranran.

08:09.900 --> 08:10.720
I'm an orphan.

08:11.120 --> 08:12.870
According to the man who found me when I was little,

08:12.950 --> 08:13.830
I floated along the river

08:13.920 --> 08:15.070
to Xue Village.

08:15.630 --> 08:16.190
I grew up

08:16.270 --> 08:17.390
eating my neighbors' food.

08:18.070 --> 08:19.310
They all say I might be

08:19.470 --> 08:20.660
a glutton in my previous life

08:20.920 --> 08:21.830
for me to be so gifted

08:21.830 --> 08:22.920
in this life.

08:23.270 --> 08:25.120
As long as I've smelled it,

08:25.140 --> 08:26.190
I can cook it.

08:27.160 --> 08:28.830
I like the world in a dish,

08:29.240 --> 08:31.120
but I yearn to see the outside world even more.

08:31.800 --> 08:32.870
I hope I'll get to taste

08:33.049 --> 08:34.049
the world's delicacies

08:34.320 --> 08:36.000
with my friend someday.

08:37.870 --> 08:38.669
This is my friend,

08:38.909 --> 08:39.669
Ling Xiao.

08:40.360 --> 08:41.720
I don't know where it came from,

08:42.150 --> 08:43.270
but we've relied

08:43.510 --> 08:44.750
on each other since I was little.

09:29.740 --> 09:30.460
Step aside!

09:45.150 --> 09:46.600
But as I grew up,

09:46.800 --> 09:48.280
Ling Xiao became less and less energetic.

09:49.270 --> 09:50.240
It's as if it has

09:50.240 --> 09:51.390
a serious illness.

09:52.320 --> 09:54.000
I also want to leave the village sooner

09:54.160 --> 09:55.670
to find a way to save it.

09:57.390 --> 09:58.480
Throughout my life,

09:59.320 --> 10:00.600
you've been the only one by my side.

10:01.910 --> 10:03.080
You're my only companion.

10:13.120 --> 10:14.200
You will be fine.

10:14.960 --> 10:16.150
I promise I'll find a way

10:16.150 --> 10:16.870
to save you.

10:18.590 --> 10:20.400
[Wei Jiu, Sovereign of Scarlet Sect]

10:21.480 --> 10:22.930
Greetings, My Lord.

10:22.360 --> 10:23.340
[Grand Hall, Scarlet Sect]

10:24.000 --> 10:25.080
Thank you, My Lord.

10:29.120 --> 10:30.240
Congratulations, My Lord.

10:31.150 --> 10:32.430
The Creator Barrier

10:32.430 --> 10:34.270
set by Su Yishui was impregnable.

10:34.750 --> 10:36.030
After 18 years of effort,

10:36.240 --> 10:37.600
you've found the barrier-breaking compass

10:36.600 --> 10:39.520
[Da Wu, Elder of Scarlet Sect]

10:37.600 --> 10:38.960
made with the Dragon Bone.

10:39.910 --> 10:41.150
With this compass,

10:41.480 --> 10:42.360
all barriers

10:42.440 --> 10:43.390
can be broken.

10:54.260 --> 10:57.230
[Seclusion Cave, Mount Wester]

11:08.580 --> 11:12.330
[Reincarnation Tree, Mount Absolute]

11:28.480 --> 11:29.030
My Lord.

11:29.870 --> 11:31.320
We'll douse this Reincarnation Tree

11:31.670 --> 11:32.870
with the liquid refined with resentment,

11:33.200 --> 11:34.440
and its Fruits will absorb it.

11:35.000 --> 11:36.510
After Mu Qingge is born,

11:36.670 --> 11:37.950
you can control her.

11:38.670 --> 11:40.590
Mu Qingge's born with the Five Spirit Roots.

11:41.000 --> 11:42.510
If you acquire her Spirit Roots,

11:42.920 --> 11:43.990
they'll aid you to reach

11:44.270 --> 11:45.880
the peak of Nascent Soul cultivation.

11:46.910 --> 11:47.790
Mu Qingge.

11:49.180 --> 11:50.940
Your Spirit Roots will be mine.

12:08.270 --> 12:08.750
This is...

12:09.440 --> 12:10.390
Another Reincarnation Fruit

12:10.390 --> 12:11.080
fell off first!

12:11.550 --> 12:12.690
There are two reincarnators

12:12.720 --> 12:13.480
on this mountain?

12:14.320 --> 12:16.030
When Mu Qingge was killed,

12:16.330 --> 12:17.970
her ordinary sister was also

12:18.080 --> 12:19.030
by her side.

12:19.480 --> 12:20.670
That unlucky girl must've been

12:21.300 --> 12:21.970
dragged into

12:22.000 --> 12:23.600
this Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Curse

12:24.150 --> 12:25.390
and then reborn

12:25.630 --> 12:27.270
through Su Yishui's help

12:27.440 --> 12:28.550
by some stroke of luck.

12:28.750 --> 12:29.720
Is Mu Qingge

12:30.060 --> 12:31.300
the one that fell off

12:31.510 --> 12:32.470
or the one on the Tree?

12:32.870 --> 12:34.360
It fell before it was ripe,

12:33.040 --> 12:35.560
[Tu Jiuyuan, Elder of Scarlet Sect]

12:34.870 --> 12:36.200
so it must be someone inept.

12:37.000 --> 12:38.390
Mu Qingge is extraordinarily gifted,

12:38.950 --> 12:40.150
so she must be the one on the Tree.

12:43.440 --> 12:44.410
Not necessarily.

12:46.880 --> 12:48.630
[Su Yishui, Sovereign of Wester Sect]

12:57.160 --> 12:58.430
Su Yishui.

12:58.950 --> 13:00.240
You sealed your five senses

13:00.270 --> 13:02.320
and cultivated the Unfeeling Mantra for 18 years.

13:02.440 --> 13:03.750
It's near completion.

13:04.320 --> 13:06.840
You used half of the Ice Lotus to rebuild your Golden Core

13:07.030 --> 13:08.630
and just entered the Transcendence Realm.

13:08.720 --> 13:10.600
You'll be stable in about a month.

13:10.900 --> 13:13.140
Why did you forcefully stop it now?

13:40.200 --> 13:41.350
-Congrats on your completion, Guardian.
-Congrats on your completion, Guardian.

13:42.030 --> 13:42.670
Rise.

13:43.190 --> 13:44.090
[Yu Tong] [Yu Chen]

13:43.190 --> 13:44.090
[Trusted servants of Su Yishui]

13:43.360 --> 13:43.910
-Yes.
-Yes.

13:46.000 --> 13:47.030
Mount Absolute's in trouble.

13:50.400 --> 13:51.880
No matter who's the one that fell,

13:52.400 --> 13:53.660
find her.

13:53.830 --> 13:55.520
How could a Reincarnation Fruit fall prematurely?

13:58.370 --> 13:59.560
That demoness is impossibly evil.

13:59.630 --> 14:01.080
She didn't even spare her own sister

14:01.200 --> 14:02.360
and squeezed her down the Tree?

14:03.910 --> 14:05.000
If Wei Jiu catches her...

14:05.870 --> 14:06.440
It's not her.

14:07.750 --> 14:08.480
Ranran!

14:09.720 --> 14:10.790
Ranran, you know what?

14:10.810 --> 14:12.120
The customer at Table A

14:12.120 --> 14:13.630
is really hard to serve.

14:13.910 --> 14:15.000
But he's full of praise

14:15.020 --> 14:16.230
for your cooking.

14:19.720 --> 14:20.440
What's wrong?

14:21.480 --> 14:23.030
Still worrying about Ling Xiao?

14:25.510 --> 14:27.100
Have you saved up enough money

14:27.320 --> 14:28.080
and plan on bringing

14:28.080 --> 14:29.080
Ling Xiao to see a doctor?

14:30.240 --> 14:31.550
None of the villagers

14:31.960 --> 14:33.440
have ever seen any Heavenly Ones.

14:33.960 --> 14:34.550
I bet

14:35.000 --> 14:35.630
there's someone

14:35.940 --> 14:37.300
who has the answer I want.

14:38.480 --> 14:39.910
Someone?

14:40.440 --> 14:42.240
Don't you mean Young Master Yu?

14:42.810 --> 14:44.410
Let's see...

14:44.440 --> 14:45.510
It’s about time

14:45.750 --> 14:47.440
he arrives for some wine.

14:48.270 --> 14:49.320
Every time he comes,

14:49.440 --> 14:50.510
he'd just order this wine.

14:50.960 --> 14:52.550
He said it tastes similar

14:52.570 --> 14:53.880
to a wine his old friend likes.

14:54.510 --> 14:55.510
But every batch I made

14:55.630 --> 14:56.910
missed the mark just a bit.

14:57.390 --> 14:58.720
I've tweaked the recipe endlessly this year.

14:58.840 --> 14:59.870
I hope he'll like it.

15:05.910 --> 15:06.720
Young Master Yu.

15:07.510 --> 15:08.600
Every time you're here,

15:08.670 --> 15:10.000
you look at the mountain far away.

15:10.510 --> 15:11.960
What is on that mountain?

15:13.320 --> 15:14.390
Someone who doesn't return.

15:15.120 --> 15:16.000
Is it the friend

15:16.030 --> 15:17.510
you mentioned who likes drinking?

15:18.280 --> 15:20.680
[Su Yu, Crown Prince]

15:20.600 --> 15:21.000
By the way,

15:21.060 --> 15:22.110
in this year's batch of wine,

15:22.370 --> 15:24.100
I added some bamboo leaves and smoked plums.

15:24.270 --> 15:25.000
See if it

15:25.220 --> 15:25.930
tastes like

15:25.960 --> 15:27.270
the Mistaken Divine your friend loves.

15:33.260 --> 15:35.380
There are eight villages and three towns down Mount Absolute.

15:36.430 --> 15:37.710
This is the last village.

15:38.590 --> 15:39.640
Keep it down.

15:40.200 --> 15:41.560
Don't alarm the Heavenly Ones nearby.

15:53.070 --> 15:54.400
He was born in the Year of Qinggeng.

15:54.630 --> 15:55.150
Seize him.

16:00.960 --> 16:01.650
Young Master!

16:08.240 --> 16:09.030
Demons?

16:09.270 --> 16:10.510
Someone was caught by demons!

16:11.340 --> 16:11.910
Demons!

16:11.930 --> 16:12.810
Someone was caught by demons!

16:12.840 --> 16:13.480
Someone was caught by demons!

16:13.500 --> 16:14.310
Someone was caught by demons!

16:29.120 --> 16:29.720
Cui!

16:30.390 --> 16:30.870
Cui!

16:41.960 --> 16:42.670
Ling Xiao.

16:43.150 --> 16:44.150
Is this a demon

16:44.150 --> 16:45.390
the storyteller talks about?

16:46.390 --> 16:47.030
Cui!

16:47.750 --> 16:48.440
Cui!

16:49.150 --> 16:49.550
Cui!

16:52.440 --> 16:53.040
Could it be...

16:55.100 --> 16:55.930
You don't need power

16:55.960 --> 16:57.120
to use these talismans that Feng

16:57.560 --> 16:58.290
infused with power.

16:58.870 --> 16:59.630
In danger,

17:00.000 --> 17:01.150
they might help you.

17:02.360 --> 17:03.910
This should be the Tracking Talisman.

17:07.109 --> 17:08.030
Track this wine's smell

17:08.030 --> 17:08.750
and find Cui.

17:08.829 --> 17:10.160
Track this wine's smell—

17:11.480 --> 17:12.720
One of you

17:13.130 --> 17:13.890
can

17:14.780 --> 17:16.690
help our sovereign cultivate.

17:19.310 --> 17:20.349
If we can't find her,

17:20.750 --> 17:21.589
you'll all become

17:21.589 --> 17:23.030
the ashes of the Scarlet Sect!

17:33.510 --> 17:34.400
None of them are?

17:37.030 --> 17:37.550
I'm confused.

17:37.790 --> 17:39.160
Every one born in the Year of Qinggeng

17:39.600 --> 17:40.560
in the village chief's records

17:40.590 --> 17:41.310
are here.

17:41.350 --> 17:42.440
Who's the village chief?

17:43.070 --> 17:44.240
It... It's me.

17:45.720 --> 17:47.640
Where are the other Year-of-Qinggeng births?

17:48.030 --> 17:49.310
T-There's no one else.

17:51.680 --> 17:52.310
That's all?

17:57.240 --> 17:59.160
Do you know how many steps it takes for a demon

17:59.160 --> 18:00.070
to cultivate a Mortal Core?

18:00.710 --> 18:01.720
You'll be tempered in fire,

18:02.440 --> 18:03.310
marinated in demonic herbs,

18:03.790 --> 18:04.550
frozen when plump,

18:04.570 --> 18:05.940
and then have your Spirit Roots removed.

18:06.070 --> 18:06.920
Finally,

18:07.510 --> 18:08.750
you'll be thrown into the furnace

18:09.310 --> 18:11.070
and tempered into a Tonic Core.

18:11.510 --> 18:12.400
I know!

18:13.480 --> 18:14.000
There's one more.

18:14.030 --> 18:14.680
I know who

18:14.700 --> 18:15.620
you're looking for.

18:20.240 --> 18:21.070
Who?

18:21.640 --> 18:23.030
She's an orphan.

18:23.420 --> 18:24.460
She even has

18:24.850 --> 18:25.880
a moving vine.

18:25.970 --> 18:27.620
You must be looking for her.

18:29.360 --> 18:30.880
I can take you to her.

18:31.620 --> 18:33.100
L-Let me go.

18:35.350 --> 18:37.440
Are you teaching me what to do?

18:48.720 --> 18:49.200
No.

18:49.770 --> 18:50.890
I've to go to town

18:51.200 --> 18:52.350
to find Mr. Yu’s immortal master

18:52.350 --> 18:53.030
to save them.

18:56.200 --> 18:56.750
Who's there?

19:00.440 --> 19:01.550
Leave! Leave!

19:31.790 --> 19:33.440
I'm afraid premature Fruits

19:34.490 --> 19:36.340
are neither fully in the Yin or Yang Realms

19:36.550 --> 19:38.230
and have unstable souls.

19:39.640 --> 19:41.790
I won’t let you escape.

19:55.080 --> 19:56.070
What's going on?

20:05.200 --> 20:05.750
Go.

20:06.640 --> 20:07.880
Get her back here.

20:09.260 --> 20:09.880
Yes.

21:12.070 --> 21:13.000
Shoo, evil spirit!

21:17.120 --> 21:17.990
Are you afraid of me?

21:18.240 --> 21:18.930
Oh no.

21:19.140 --> 21:20.760
This evil spirit is so powerful.

21:27.030 --> 21:28.350
Every injustice has its perpetrator.

21:29.270 --> 21:31.070
Go look for the one who made you die

21:31.110 --> 21:32.020
beyond recognition.

21:32.550 --> 21:33.510
It's not my fault.

21:35.510 --> 21:36.680
You don't remember anything?

21:40.520 --> 21:42.170
Su Yishui of Wester Sect?

21:42.510 --> 21:44.070
You treacherous loser.

21:44.310 --> 21:45.070
How dare you

21:45.070 --> 21:46.350
steal for someone with us

21:46.420 --> 21:48.210
with a face full of shameful marks?

21:49.160 --> 21:50.240
Since you recognized me,

21:50.510 --> 21:51.830
-you must die.
-Scarlet Sect?

21:54.070 --> 21:55.000
Su Yishui?

21:56.050 --> 21:56.930
Is he the heartless one

21:56.960 --> 21:58.470
in the storyteller's story

21:58.880 --> 21:59.790
who even killed

21:59.790 --> 22:01.310
his own master?

22:02.200 --> 22:04.400
Isn't that scarier than evil spirits?

22:39.790 --> 22:40.640
Well...

22:41.440 --> 22:43.110
Sorry for offending you.

22:43.310 --> 22:45.830
I need to find an immortal master to save the people.

22:46.470 --> 22:47.270
Goodbye.

22:56.860 --> 22:57.940
The demonic energy invaded her bones?

22:59.960 --> 23:01.030
Ling Xiao, come back!

23:13.110 --> 23:13.920
It hurts...

23:16.270 --> 23:17.310
What are you doing?

23:18.310 --> 23:19.070
It hurts...

23:27.790 --> 23:29.270
She actually has a broken heart.

23:31.420 --> 23:33.160
Guardian, she's lucky you disguised her appearance

23:32.010 --> 23:36.040
[Ranran's home, Xue Village]

23:33.200 --> 23:34.750
so the Scarlet Sect didn't get her.

23:35.200 --> 23:35.830
I thought you

23:35.830 --> 23:37.030
sacrificing half of your Golden Core

23:37.160 --> 23:38.200
to revive that demoness

23:38.440 --> 23:39.070
would lift

23:39.070 --> 23:40.270
the curses on you and Wester Sect.

23:40.510 --> 23:41.400
I never imagined

23:41.550 --> 23:42.440
that she'd be reborn

23:42.440 --> 23:43.400
with an Incomplete Spirit Root

23:43.730 --> 23:44.760
who can't even withstand

23:44.790 --> 23:46.110
this little demonic energy from a secondary beast.

23:46.680 --> 23:47.400
She fell off the Tree

23:47.400 --> 23:48.510
before being fully

23:48.750 --> 23:49.680
nourished,

23:50.160 --> 23:51.200
so her heart's broken.

23:51.790 --> 23:52.920
It's a sign of premature aging.

23:53.440 --> 23:54.480
She is lucky that she's lived

23:54.480 --> 23:55.310
until now.

23:55.480 --> 23:56.240
If she dies,

23:56.240 --> 23:57.310
who can lift your curse?

23:58.000 --> 23:59.180
How about infusing her with power?

23:59.640 --> 24:00.160
I tried.

24:00.920 --> 24:02.160
I can't access her heart.

24:02.550 --> 24:03.400
Could it be that

24:03.510 --> 24:05.180
since she was your master in her previous life

24:05.350 --> 24:06.400
and your master-disciple pact

24:06.400 --> 24:07.720
was carried on to her next life,

24:08.350 --> 24:09.790
so you're not allowed access

24:09.960 --> 24:10.790
into her heart?

24:12.750 --> 24:14.150
The master-disciple pact is a blood pact.

24:15.000 --> 24:16.110
It can only be suppressed with another

24:16.110 --> 24:16.680
blood pact.

24:17.960 --> 24:19.920
Of the six pacts, the master-disciple pact is superior

24:20.340 --> 24:21.300
and never to be broken.

24:21.920 --> 24:22.790
In this world,

24:22.840 --> 24:23.760
what other blood pact

24:23.790 --> 24:25.030
could override it?

24:25.550 --> 24:26.110
There's one.

24:26.920 --> 24:28.000
Another master-disciple pact.

24:30.920 --> 24:31.440
Wait.

24:31.920 --> 24:32.880
You want to...

24:33.110 --> 24:34.030
Take her as my disciple

24:34.350 --> 24:35.680
to nullify the original pact.

24:38.270 --> 24:38.960
Guardian.

24:39.110 --> 24:40.750
Becoming the master of your master?

24:41.400 --> 24:42.830
It's such a bold

24:42.830 --> 24:43.880
and creative...

24:45.270 --> 24:47.230
and deviant method.

24:52.590 --> 24:53.030
Guardian.

24:53.350 --> 24:54.590
Why don't you reconsider it?

24:55.040 --> 24:56.280
There hasn't been such a precedent

24:56.310 --> 24:57.070
in the cultivation world.

24:57.590 --> 24:59.310
You've to endure the pressure of the laws of nature.

24:59.680 --> 25:00.720
I doubt you'd even be

25:00.880 --> 25:01.790
able to defy her.

25:03.110 --> 25:04.030
Besides,

25:04.530 --> 25:05.310
a lot goes into

25:05.330 --> 25:06.530
being a master.

25:07.640 --> 25:08.960
You've never been a master.

25:09.590 --> 25:10.110
Can you do it?

25:12.270 --> 25:12.920
Is it that hard?

25:14.480 --> 25:15.270
Since you've decided,

25:15.320 --> 25:16.580
let's return to Mount Wester

25:16.600 --> 25:17.550
and make it happen.

25:17.920 --> 25:18.550
Not yet.

25:18.920 --> 25:20.160
Her Fruit fell prematurely.

25:20.440 --> 25:21.350
She'll die instantly

25:21.370 --> 25:22.610
when she's too far from the Tree.

25:23.400 --> 25:24.920
She has never left Mount Absolute.

25:25.070 --> 25:26.000
Go to Mount Absolute

25:26.000 --> 25:27.200
and break off a branch from the Tree.

25:28.480 --> 25:29.160
One more thing.

25:29.900 --> 25:31.490
I can't confront Wei Jiu directly.

25:32.110 --> 25:33.200
Inform the Four Sects.

25:33.790 --> 25:34.350
Got it.

25:34.920 --> 25:36.310
Xue Ranran's Spirit Root is incomplete,

25:36.510 --> 25:37.920
but it's actually formless.

25:38.400 --> 25:39.070
She's like

25:39.070 --> 25:40.070
an Immortal Fruit.

25:40.310 --> 25:41.640
We mustn't let the Scarlet Sect get her.

25:41.660 --> 25:42.730
Formless Spirit Root?

25:43.440 --> 25:44.310
Immortal Fruit?

25:44.640 --> 25:45.790
She must stay in Mount Wester.

25:46.440 --> 25:46.960
Go on.

25:48.070 --> 25:48.420
Yes.

25:49.110 --> 25:50.680
So he didn't save me by accident.

25:51.160 --> 25:52.750
He's been targeting me.

25:53.270 --> 25:54.880
Just like the demonic cultivators,

25:55.440 --> 25:56.240
the Westers want to eat me!

26:04.350 --> 26:04.960
You're awake.

26:11.730 --> 26:13.320
Why are his face tattoos

26:13.350 --> 26:14.200
gone?

26:15.110 --> 26:15.680
What's wrong?

26:16.550 --> 26:17.680
Do I look very scary?

26:19.260 --> 26:20.090
No, no.

26:20.750 --> 26:21.790
Your profile is

26:21.880 --> 26:23.590
so gorgeous that I can't take my eyes off you.

26:23.680 --> 26:24.790
It's far from being scary.

26:25.440 --> 26:25.880
Really?

26:26.810 --> 26:28.330
It's rare that someone's not afraid

26:28.880 --> 26:29.680
of my true face.

26:30.070 --> 26:31.200
It must be fate.

26:31.400 --> 26:32.400
I'll take you as my disciple.

26:33.270 --> 26:33.920
No, no.

26:34.350 --> 26:35.840
I have something urgent to attend to.

26:36.160 --> 26:37.520
You must've got the wrong person.

26:37.550 --> 26:38.270
It's definitely you.

26:38.830 --> 26:40.540
Born on September 9 in the Year of Qinggeng.

26:40.960 --> 26:42.550
You had a plum blossom mole on your face,

26:42.570 --> 26:43.850
which disappeared when you were five.

26:44.400 --> 26:45.830
You're destined with the Wester Sect.

26:48.200 --> 26:49.880
You're great at reading fortunes, huh?

26:51.030 --> 26:52.790
But the immortal path is too elusive.

26:52.860 --> 26:54.190
It's not the life I want.

26:54.400 --> 26:55.550
If you don't go up the mountain with me,

26:55.960 --> 26:57.240
you'll die of heart failure soon.

26:57.750 --> 26:59.160
Trying to scare me, huh?

26:59.880 --> 27:01.350
That's my fate then.

27:01.510 --> 27:02.960
You don't have to worry about it.

27:03.160 --> 27:04.240
Your life is mine.

27:04.820 --> 27:05.750
If I don't let you die,

27:05.830 --> 27:06.780
you can't die.

27:07.030 --> 27:08.680
Why are you forcing me?

27:09.070 --> 27:10.830
It's a Wester tradition to force apprenticeship.

27:11.310 --> 27:12.030
Back in the days,

27:12.030 --> 27:12.960
my master did the same.

27:13.790 --> 27:14.590
Is it that odd?

27:15.680 --> 27:17.160
Aren't you a righteous sect?

27:17.350 --> 27:18.550
Who said Mount Wester is a righteous sect?

27:19.310 --> 27:20.750
The Westers only follow their own way.

27:21.310 --> 27:22.350
Whether it's righteous or evil,

27:22.510 --> 27:23.350
we do as we will.

27:24.240 --> 27:25.720
This is the jade tablet of Wester disciples.

27:25.880 --> 27:27.030
You have to drop your blood into it

27:27.060 --> 27:27.740
and perform

27:28.110 --> 27:29.240
an apprenticeship ceremony.

27:31.030 --> 27:32.030
No thanks...

27:34.200 --> 27:35.160
The fortune teller

27:35.480 --> 27:37.480
said I'm born a jinx to my family

27:37.960 --> 27:38.880
and teachers.

27:39.240 --> 27:40.310
It's for your own good.

27:40.550 --> 27:41.440
Kneel and take me as your master.

27:45.920 --> 27:46.880
What's wrong with you?

27:47.160 --> 27:48.270
How can you get others to kneel?

27:48.400 --> 27:49.550
Will you kneel if I ask you to?

27:51.940 --> 27:53.660
Sov... Sovereign Su.

27:54.390 --> 27:55.750
Why are you really on your knees?

27:55.920 --> 27:57.230
I wasn't serious.

27:57.790 --> 27:59.480
The jade tablet is the Westers' sacred object.

27:59.880 --> 28:00.550
Are there still

28:00.550 --> 28:01.750
remnants of Mu Qingge's authority?

28:03.550 --> 28:04.270
Go out!

28:10.350 --> 28:11.000
My Lord!

28:13.440 --> 28:14.920
We have help.

28:17.000 --> 28:18.000
Okay.

28:18.640 --> 28:20.480
Let's see how long you can hide.

28:28.160 --> 28:30.160
Her authority is really hard to overcome.

28:36.930 --> 28:38.040
The jade tablet

28:38.070 --> 28:39.240
is really something.

28:39.680 --> 28:41.200
It's like it can control Su Yishui.

28:50.400 --> 28:50.920
Right!

28:51.350 --> 28:52.100
Maybe it could

28:52.200 --> 28:53.510
command him to save the people.

28:55.270 --> 28:55.960
Su Yishui.

28:56.270 --> 28:57.640
Go and save the people—

29:03.750 --> 29:04.510
You can leave.

29:05.480 --> 29:06.480
But I guess

29:07.000 --> 29:08.510
that within 15 minutes,

29:08.880 --> 29:10.080
Wei Jiu will turn your friends

29:10.110 --> 29:11.160
into a pillar of smoke.

29:13.880 --> 29:14.590
Immortal Master.

29:15.080 --> 29:16.190
Please save them.

29:16.830 --> 29:17.640
Then first,

29:18.200 --> 29:19.000
take me as your master.

29:23.350 --> 29:24.070
Immortal Master.

29:24.350 --> 29:26.070
You look like a righteous man.

29:26.240 --> 29:27.440
You won't just let them die.

29:27.880 --> 29:28.650
Come to think of it,

29:28.680 --> 29:30.480
the Wester Sect is better than Scarlet Sect.

29:30.680 --> 29:31.240
As long as

29:31.240 --> 29:32.240
you save my friends,

29:32.510 --> 29:33.550
I could become your disciple.

29:34.240 --> 29:35.030
Right, Master?

29:35.750 --> 29:36.640
You have no parents

29:37.070 --> 29:37.890
and no one to rely on,

29:38.830 --> 29:40.200
yet you bother to stand up for them?

29:41.030 --> 29:41.880
I'm indebted

29:42.110 --> 29:43.240
to every family here.

29:43.800 --> 29:45.070
I can't ignore them.

29:46.310 --> 29:46.920
It's a deal.

29:52.790 --> 29:53.350
It's a promise:

29:53.810 --> 29:54.570
I'll be your disciple,

29:55.960 --> 29:56.550
and you'll save them.

30:01.590 --> 30:02.200
Master.

30:05.440 --> 30:06.270
Put your hand on it

30:06.720 --> 30:07.480
and make a soul oath.

30:19.640 --> 30:20.640
As long as you

30:21.000 --> 30:22.480
personally save my friends,

30:22.720 --> 30:24.200
I'll be willing to be your disciple.

30:24.400 --> 30:25.340
If I break my promise,

30:25.440 --> 30:26.270
my mortal body

30:26.350 --> 30:27.160
will disintegrate.

30:32.240 --> 30:33.110
Pour me some tea

30:33.930 --> 30:35.410
and then get registered at Mount Wester,

30:35.510 --> 30:36.350
and we'll be done.

30:47.590 --> 30:48.590
Help!

30:54.920 --> 30:55.680
Thank goodness for

30:55.700 --> 30:56.700
the talisman from Mr. Yu.

30:57.960 --> 30:58.720
Trying to trick me?

30:59.030 --> 31:00.590
Since you want to be a coward,

31:00.790 --> 31:02.550
I'll provoke you to battle.

31:10.440 --> 31:11.350
Using your brainpower

31:11.550 --> 31:13.110
on such trifling tricks?

31:16.550 --> 31:18.070
A talisman from the Imperial Exotic Pavilion?

31:19.440 --> 31:21.030
Su Yu must also be nearby.

31:22.160 --> 31:22.960
Why would he…

31:29.270 --> 31:29.860
Chase him!

32:14.070 --> 32:15.160
Wei Jiu,

32:15.790 --> 32:17.790
trespassing the Crown Prince's bedchamber?

32:18.000 --> 32:19.400
You've got some nerve.

32:20.070 --> 32:20.920
Are you intent

32:20.350 --> 32:22.320
[Feng, immortal master]

32:20.920 --> 32:22.550
on going against Exotic Pavilion?

32:30.590 --> 32:31.790
Exotic Pavilion?

32:32.290 --> 32:33.120
I have zero regard

32:33.140 --> 32:34.140
for it.

32:35.110 --> 32:35.790
However,

32:35.960 --> 32:37.480
someone lured disaster to the east.

32:38.200 --> 32:39.680
I don’t want to be made a fool.

32:44.270 --> 32:45.440
My Lord, bad news.

32:45.870 --> 32:47.240
The sovereigns of the Four Sects are here.

32:47.880 --> 32:49.110
These old foxes

32:49.400 --> 32:50.830
sure are easily alerted.

32:51.920 --> 32:52.350
Retreat.

33:03.400 --> 33:04.240
Ling Xiao!

33:06.000 --> 33:06.750
Ling Xiao!

33:09.110 --> 33:09.960
Ling Xiao!

33:11.240 --> 33:11.920
Ling Xiao!

33:12.790 --> 33:13.640
Ling Xiao!

33:17.960 --> 33:19.270
S-Sovereign Su.

33:21.110 --> 33:22.270
You're so fast.

33:22.880 --> 33:23.640
I didn't want to

33:24.000 --> 33:24.760
miss out on the tea

33:24.780 --> 33:25.650
from my dear disciple.

33:25.680 --> 33:26.480
Am I right?

33:27.510 --> 33:29.720
Although you distracted the demons away...

33:30.640 --> 33:32.200
you didn't save the people personally.

33:33.240 --> 33:33.880
Is that so?

33:34.720 --> 33:35.790
You left in a hurry

33:36.750 --> 33:37.590
and forgot about this.

33:40.200 --> 33:40.880
Ling Xiao.

33:40.960 --> 33:41.680
Give it back!

33:42.550 --> 33:43.200
Move aside!

33:53.920 --> 33:54.920
The Blood Chalcedony

33:54.480 --> 33:56.540
[Blood Chalcedony drawing]

33:55.110 --> 33:56.640
is great for nourishing the soul.

33:58.380 --> 33:59.970
That Blood Chalcedony can save Ling Xiao.

34:03.790 --> 34:04.640
If I save it,

34:05.130 --> 34:05.610
does it count as

34:05.640 --> 34:06.680
me personally saving your friend?

34:07.400 --> 34:07.920
Yes.

34:08.150 --> 34:09.030
Don't hurt it.

34:10.030 --> 34:11.030
To save Ling Xiao,

34:11.409 --> 34:12.040
even if

34:12.070 --> 34:13.320
Mount Wester is perilous,

34:13.630 --> 34:14.590
I've to give it a try.

34:17.920 --> 34:19.360
You are so powerful.

34:21.190 --> 34:22.070
I won't run away.

34:22.880 --> 34:24.000
I'll be your disciple.

34:27.989 --> 34:30.510
[Mount Wester]

34:46.389 --> 34:49.270
[Mu Qingge, founder of Wester Sect]

34:49.110 --> 34:50.360
This is my Mount Wester.

34:55.880 --> 34:57.000
Remember the route.

34:57.280 --> 34:58.190
Once I get it,

34:58.440 --> 34:59.230
I'll flee.

35:00.630 --> 35:01.480
What's on your mind?

35:03.350 --> 35:04.810
Master, you told me

35:04.840 --> 35:05.960
Mount Wester is beautiful

35:05.980 --> 35:06.820
with a pleasant climate.

35:06.950 --> 35:08.180
Since I can cultivate here,

35:08.360 --> 35:10.120
I feel carefree, jubilant,

35:10.150 --> 35:11.150
truly blessed,

35:11.230 --> 35:12.070
and content.

35:13.760 --> 35:15.250
Your blood is in the jade tablet.

35:15.280 --> 35:16.960
No matter where you go, I'll be able to find you.

35:17.670 --> 35:18.590
Don't think about fleeing.

35:18.920 --> 35:20.150
You'll die if you leave Mount Wester.

35:21.060 --> 35:22.030
Threatening me, huh?

35:23.550 --> 35:24.110
Guardian.

35:24.870 --> 35:25.950
Yu Chen told me in a letter

35:25.970 --> 35:27.280
that you personally took in a disciple.

35:27.960 --> 35:29.000
This is that

35:29.190 --> 35:30.000
Xue Ranran?

35:33.440 --> 35:34.230
Settle her in.

35:44.490 --> 35:48.680
[Grand Hall]

35:49.440 --> 35:51.360
This spirit stone can identify your Spirit Roots.

35:51.840 --> 35:53.820
Your elemental Roots determine your cultivation gift.

35:54.250 --> 35:55.130
The more you have,

35:55.470 --> 35:56.660
the more gifted you are.

35:57.190 --> 35:58.110
Test it out.

35:58.550 --> 35:59.830
I'll go prepare the apprenticeship ceremony.

36:06.400 --> 36:07.510
I'm Bai Baishan

36:08.030 --> 36:09.360
from a family of immortal cultivators.

36:10.010 --> 36:12.010
[Bai Baishan]

36:10.070 --> 36:11.070
I've already been tested.

36:14.810 --> 36:15.560
Gold and Water;

36:15.960 --> 36:17.360
two Spirit Roots.

36:20.450 --> 36:21.380
I'm Gao Cang

36:21.410 --> 36:24.210
[Gao Cang]

36:21.520 --> 36:22.240
with an Earth Root.

36:23.400 --> 36:25.480
My family's acquainted with Master,

36:25.550 --> 36:27.070
so despite my low qualifications,

36:27.150 --> 36:27.800
he still took me in.

36:28.600 --> 36:30.530
[Qiu Xi'er]

36:29.360 --> 36:30.250
I have a Fire Spirit Root.

36:30.280 --> 36:31.000
I'm Qiu Xi'er.

36:33.150 --> 36:34.400
You must be Ranran.

36:34.630 --> 36:35.590
I heard about another lady

36:35.590 --> 36:36.230
joining

36:36.230 --> 36:36.960
upon entering.

36:38.550 --> 36:39.190
Were you all

36:39.840 --> 36:41.400
taken here by force too?

36:42.110 --> 36:42.550
What?

36:43.190 --> 36:44.320
By force?

36:45.840 --> 36:47.480
It's the first time Master is taking disciples.

36:47.880 --> 36:48.730
Everyone was

36:48.750 --> 36:50.320
busy vying for a spot.

36:50.800 --> 36:51.350
What?

36:52.100 --> 36:52.950
Could it be...

36:52.980 --> 36:54.440
you are extraordinary

36:54.460 --> 36:56.090
and have all Five Spirit Roots,

36:56.120 --> 36:57.770
so Master was desperate for you?

37:07.440 --> 37:08.920
Incomplete Spirit Root?

37:09.190 --> 37:10.800
Not even one?

37:13.070 --> 37:15.440
A loser who's born incompetent

37:15.460 --> 37:17.180
and won't amount to much even with hard work.

37:17.510 --> 37:18.440
How in the world

37:18.440 --> 37:19.510
did you get

37:19.760 --> 37:21.110
Master to take you in?

37:22.670 --> 37:23.760
Are you curious?

37:24.510 --> 37:26.070
Why don't you ask Master yourself?

37:28.050 --> 37:29.430
It's time for the apprenticeship ceremony.

37:29.590 --> 37:30.400
Let's go. Come on.

37:31.280 --> 37:32.070
Yeah, come on.

37:32.590 --> 37:33.280
Look.

37:33.400 --> 37:34.230
The rules are here.

37:40.720 --> 37:42.920
You should always dress up

37:42.940 --> 37:44.010
and look good...

37:45.180 --> 37:45.990
to please...

37:46.590 --> 37:47.480
the Master?

37:48.030 --> 37:49.630
Don't be promiscuous,

37:50.000 --> 37:51.000
but more importantly,

37:51.480 --> 37:52.710
don't be indifferent?

37:53.030 --> 37:55.840
You should study more about playing.

37:56.260 --> 37:57.220
Don't stay in the cave—

37:57.240 --> 37:58.880
Don't stay in the cave cultivating?

37:59.320 --> 38:00.740
I've only heard the Heavenly Sects advocate

38:00.760 --> 38:01.720
detachment.

38:02.030 --> 38:03.510
These rules are quite interesting.

38:05.400 --> 38:06.150
Can you do it?

38:14.440 --> 38:15.480
Such rules

38:15.690 --> 38:17.450
made my eyes light up

38:17.480 --> 38:18.360
and spoke to my heart.

38:18.510 --> 38:19.510
I'll try my best to adhere to them.

38:22.800 --> 38:23.840
How about

38:24.110 --> 38:26.590
I wear a beautiful dress tomorrow

38:26.800 --> 38:28.190
to look good to please you?

38:31.000 --> 38:32.750
Every rule is illogical and absurd.

38:33.180 --> 38:34.060
Can't you tell?

38:42.190 --> 38:42.880
These rules

38:43.110 --> 38:44.760
were left by Mu Qingge in the past.

38:45.240 --> 38:46.550
Don't abide by any of them.

38:50.360 --> 38:51.480
Drop your blood into the jade tablet,

38:51.510 --> 38:52.400
serve Master tea,

38:52.670 --> 38:54.480
and get registered in the sect's records.

38:54.670 --> 38:55.800
Then it'll be official.

38:56.230 --> 38:57.960
Let's start with the most powerful,

38:57.960 --> 38:59.320
according to

38:59.400 --> 39:00.280
your Spirit Roots.

39:09.510 --> 39:11.280
Greet your master and serve tea.

39:11.770 --> 39:12.330
Master.

39:20.880 --> 39:21.800
The ceremony is completed.

39:23.280 --> 39:24.000
Xue Ranran.

39:24.110 --> 39:25.150
It's your turn to serve tea.

39:32.150 --> 39:33.030
Greet your master

39:33.280 --> 39:33.920
and serve tea.

39:43.710 --> 39:44.150
I...

39:44.880 --> 39:46.410
I think my legs are numb.

39:46.440 --> 39:47.320
I can't kneel down.

40:05.630 --> 40:06.400
Su Yishui.

40:06.740 --> 40:08.630
You're plotting to use me to cultivate your Core.

40:08.880 --> 40:09.960
Even the heavens can't stand it.

40:14.110 --> 40:14.590
Guardian.

40:14.920 --> 40:16.110
Why don't you reconsider it?

40:16.590 --> 40:18.190
You've to endure the pressure of the laws of nature.

40:19.110 --> 40:20.320
I doubt you'd even be

40:20.320 --> 40:21.320
able to defy her.

40:27.590 --> 40:28.280
Serve the tea.

40:40.170 --> 40:41.940
Sor... Sorry, Master.

40:42.480 --> 40:44.150
As they say, spilled water can't be gathered up.

40:44.710 --> 40:46.400
Could it be that the heavens

40:46.560 --> 40:47.680
are hinting that

40:47.960 --> 40:49.590
we shouldn't be master and disciple?

40:49.840 --> 40:50.760
Spilled water

40:51.960 --> 40:52.840
can't be gathered up?

40:54.760 --> 40:56.030
I don't believe in that logic.

40:56.550 --> 40:58.070
I must drink the tea you serve.

41:25.320 --> 41:26.360
The ceremony is completed.

41:44.760 --> 41:46.320
You're now a Wester disciple

41:46.840 --> 41:47.590
and my disciple.

41:48.190 --> 41:49.590
Now that I'm your disciple,

41:50.070 --> 41:51.510
you'll have more control over me.

41:53.600 --> 41:56.490
[Westerly Valley, Mount Wester]

42:03.360 --> 42:04.880
Master, this is...

42:08.230 --> 42:09.840
You've lived in the mortal world for 18 years.

42:10.230 --> 42:11.150
You're full of mortal dust.

42:11.920 --> 42:13.230
Get thoroughly refined here

42:13.590 --> 42:14.480
to cleanse your meridians

42:14.500 --> 42:15.270
before all else.

42:42.920 --> 42:44.070
I thought we'll get to

42:45.070 --> 42:46.630
settle the score when we meet again

42:47.960 --> 42:49.590
and I'll get closure from you.

42:51.440 --> 42:52.480
It's been 18 years.

42:54.400 --> 42:55.840
I'm still waiting for your answer.

42:57.760 --> 42:59.320
But you forgot everything.

43:02.590 --> 43:04.070
I'll wait for you to remember that day.

43:05.440 --> 43:07.110
A grudge can't be left unresolved.
